        "slc_3eb0b1ac6499346667244612218bf6c166a657e747bf8bba7bba3ccbff07b8a4"
      ],
      "text": "The plugin bridges Neovim and the opencode AI agent, providing a chat interface that captures editor context such as the current file and selections, with persistent sessions tied to the workspace."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_49ca772a38e6eff8ef8ae591fa0ce3d07c2bbbbc0c1d79b39fe631c0b77879b7",
